\ by-left through whnf (plan row TB1; tests/front/tactics/goal-layer.lean):
\ a ≤ a unfolds to Nat.le a a, whose two constructors are refl and step;
\ left applies Nat.le.refl, which closes the goal. The term is
\ @Nat.le.refl a.
\ Lean: theorem le_le (a : Nat) : a ≤ a := by left
theorem le_le
  Nat explicit: a
  a a ≤
:= by
  by-left
end le_le
